<%- include('partials/header', { title }) %>

<section id="about-page">

  <div class="page-header">
    <h1 id="about-heading">About BenchmarkShop</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="about-content">

    <article id="about-mission" class="card">
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>BenchmarkShop is a neutral, open-source reference application built specifically for
         comparing web test automation tools. Every page, form, and user journey is documented
         with stable locators and ground-truth journey specifications.</p>
    </article>

    <article id="about-journeys" class="card">
      <h2>Documented User Journeys</h2>
      <ol id="journey-list">
        <li id="about-j1"><strong>Login Flow</strong> — Sign in and reach the dashboard</li>
        <li id="about-j2"><strong>Multi-step Registration</strong> — 3-step account creation</li>
        <li id="about-j3"><strong>Product → Cart → Checkout</strong> — Full purchase flow</li>
        <li id="about-j4"><strong>Navigation Menu</strong> — Explore site sub-pages</li>
        <li id="about-j5"><strong>Search → Results → Detail</strong> — Search and product discovery</li>
      </ol>
    </article>

    <article id="about-credentials" class="card">
      <h2>Test Credentials</h2>
      <table class="data-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Username</th><th>Password</th><th>Role</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr id="cred-admin"><td><code>admin</code></td><td><code>password123</code></td><td>Admin</td></tr>
          <tr id="cred-demo"> <td><code>demo</code></td> <td><code>demo123</code></td>     <td>Demo User</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </article>

    <article id="about-locators" class="card">
      <h2>Locator Strategy</h2>
      <p>All interactive elements use stable <code>id</code> attributes following the pattern
         <code>action-target[-variant]</code> (e.g. <code>add-to-cart-1</code>,
         <code>login-submit</code>, <code>nav-products</code>). These IDs are frozen and will
         not change between app versions, making them reliable benchmark selectors.</p>
    </article>

  </div>

</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
